    "updated_at": "2016-09-20T16:10:28Z",
    "body": "@domenic it is not clear to me what to proposal is. If the proposal is to align the spec with the behavior with WebKit / Blink / Gecko, then I am fine with it.\n\nIf the proposal is to keep the spec as is, then I am not sure it is worth the churn. Most browsers are aligned already.\n",
